# The bundled deck templates (12 .pptx, 70.53 MiB, 11 of them over the repo's
# 1 MiB cap) never enter git: this directory holds fetched payload only,
# pinned per file by sha256 in ../../../templates.manifest.json and pulled by
# ../../../fetch_templates.py (or copied from the vendored fork tree while it
# exists). This .gitignore is the only tracked file here, and it lands before
# any payload does, so no `git add -A` can ever stage a template.
*
!.gitignore
